1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,256
Cet homme a survécu

2
00:00:01,256 --> 00:00:02,864
à une bombe atomique…

3
00:00:02,864 --> 00:00:04,337
puis à une deuxième,

4
00:00:04,337 --> 00:00:04,810
trois jours

5
00:00:04,810 --> 00:00:05,533
plus tard.

6
00:00:05,723 --> 00:00:07,833
Le 6 août 1945,

7
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:08,949
Tsutomu Yamaguchi

8
00:00:08,949 --> 00:00:09,970
est à Hiroshima

9
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:10,951
pour son travail.

10
00:00:11,411 --> 00:00:11,781
Soudain,

11
00:00:11,781 --> 00:00:12,680
une lumière

12
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:13,894
aveuglante traverse

13
00:00:13,894 --> 00:00:14,570
le ciel.

14
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,034
Une bombe atomique

15
00:00:16,034 --> 00:00:16,675
vient d'exploser

16
00:00:16,675 --> 00:00:18,071
au-dessus de la ville.

17
00:00:18,221 --> 00:00:19,601
Gravement brûlé,

18
00:00:19,601 --> 00:00:20,144
il parvient

19
00:00:20,144 --> 00:00:21,429
pourtant à survivre.

20
00:00:21,619 --> 00:00:22,881
Mais le plus incroyable

21
00:00:22,881 --> 00:00:24,163
reste à venir.

22
00:00:24,273 --> 00:00:25,365
Malgré ses blessures,

23
00:00:25,365 --> 00:00:25,938
il rentre

24
00:00:25,938 --> 00:00:26,774
chez lui en train,

25
00:00:26,774 --> 00:00:27,906
à Nagasaki.

26
00:00:28,016 --> 00:00:28,676
Le 9 août,

27
00:00:28,676 --> 00:00:29,590
il retourne

28
00:00:29,590 --> 00:00:30,549
au travail.

29
00:00:30,549 --> 00:00:31,165
À son bureau,

30
00:00:31,165 --> 00:00:31,738
il raconte

31
00:00:31,738 --> 00:00:32,231
à son chef

32
00:00:32,231 --> 00:00:33,383
ce qu'il a vécu…

33
00:00:34,163 --> 00:00:34,480
Soudain,

34
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:35,568
une deuxième bombe

35
00:00:35,568 --> 00:00:36,607
atomique explose

36
00:00:36,607 --> 00:00:37,539
sur la ville.

37
00:00:38,169 --> 00:00:39,177
Encore une fois,

38
00:00:39,177 --> 00:00:39,949
il est à trois

39
00:00:39,949 --> 00:00:40,570
kilomètres

40
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:41,492
de l'explosion.

41
00:00:41,602 --> 00:00:43,231
Et contre toute attente…

42
00:00:43,261 --> 00:00:44,948
il survit encore.

43
00:00:45,178 --> 00:00:45,723
Il vivra

44
00:00:45,723 --> 00:00:46,978
jusqu'en 2010,

45
00:00:46,978 --> 00:00:47,406
à l'âge

46
00:00:47,406 --> 00:00:48,586
de 93 ans.

47
00:00:48,616 --> 00:00:49,161
Il reste

48
00:00:49,161 --> 00:00:50,053
le seul survivant

49
00:00:50,053 --> 00:00:51,335
officiellement reconnu

50
00:00:51,335 --> 00:00:51,733
des deux

51
00:00:51,733 --> 00:00:52,624
bombardements.

52
00:00:52,974 --> 00:00:53,780
Deux bombes.

53
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:54,637
Deux villes.

54
00:00:54,637 --> 00:00:55,649
Un survivant.

55
00:00:55,959 --> 00:00:56,567
Tu connaissais

56
00:00:56,567 --> 00:00:57,729
cette histoire ?

